</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/71afd38c-9fa5-11f1-af79-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26236363361580.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/71afd38c-9fa5-11f1-af79-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26236363361580.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">07bf190a-9fc4-11f1-8e48-f730a484eb1e</guid><pubDate>Mon, 24 Aug 2026 14:27:27 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>瑞迪</dc:creator></item><item><category>法国报纸摘要</category><title>中俄如何松解美国对伊朗的经济绞刑？</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%B8%93%E6%A0%8F%E6%A3%80%E7%B4%A2/%E6%B3%95%E5%9B%BD%E6%8A%A5%E7%BA%B8%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81/20260824-%E4%B8%AD%E4%BF%84%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E6%9D%BE%E8%A7%A3%E7%BE%8E%E5%9B%BD%E5%AF%B9%E4%BC%8A%E6%9C%97%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%8F%E6%B5%8E%E7%BB%9E%E5%88%91</link><description>
